\frac{d y}{d x}=\frac{\left(x y+y^2\right)}{\left(x^2-2 x y\right)} \Rightarrow \frac{d y}{d x}=\frac{\frac{y}{x}+\left(\frac{y}{x}\right)^2}{1-2\left(\frac{y}{x}\right)}
\end{array}$<br/>Let $\mathrm{y}=v x \Rightarrow \frac{d y}{d x}=v+\frac{x d v}{d x}$
$\begin{aligned}
